CC        SearchStages: 
CC        BufferStages:
CC        Description: ORF1 from pos 470-2911 and 3951-4532. AA
CC                     47-404 of the first ORFbis up to 20% identical
CC                     (35% similar) to Tnp2 and other En/Spm transposases
CC                     in plants.  The 15 bp TIRs and CACTGb&CAGTG
CC                     termini, also support classification as an
CC                     En/Spm DNA transposon (a.k.a as CACTA transposons
CC                     for their termini). The elements appear to
CC                     duplicate TA rather than TAA. The few copies
CC                     in the Ciona genome are the first En/Spm
CC                     members observed outside plants.       
