CC   RepeatMasker Annotations:
CC        Type: DNA
CC        SubType: hAT-Charlie
CC        Species: Metatheria, Eutheria
CC        SearchStages: 40,50
CC        BufferStages:
CC        Description: Active in eutherian ancestor. Copies in the
CC                     opossum and wallaby genomes are not at orthologous
CC                     sites. Near-identical copies are also present
CC                     in birds (predating speciation of chicken
CC                     and songbirds) and crocodiles and gharials
CC                     (post dating the split from alligators).
CC                     So, in short time Charlie7 invaded the genomes
CC                     of the ancestral eutherian, an ancestral
CC                     marsupial, an ancestral bird, and an ancestral
CC                     crocodile. ORF 386-2347 encoded a transposase
CC                     otherwise closest (44%/65%) to hAT-2_SM_tp
CC                     in the flatworm Schmidtea. Also used for
CC                     the element that spread in the marsupial
CC                     ancestor, as there are not enough full-length
CC                     elements  to derive a (perhaps slightly different)
CC                     consensus there.
//
