CC        Description: 8 bp TSDs. Updated May 2013. ORF from pos
CC                     1010-3742 encodes a hAT transposase of the
CC                     Tip100/Hitchhikers group of DNA transposons
CC                     that by now also includes elements like Arthur,
CC                     Trillian and Ford. Current closest relatives
CC                     are hAT-1_STu in the potato and Zaphod2_Osa
CC                     in rice. Common internal deletion products
CC                     are 1-67/3921-end (MER115) and 1-1005/3642-end
CC                     (not included in database). Present in all
CC                     eutheria (incl. elephant), absent from opossum
CC                     or platypus.
