CC        Species: Rattus
CC        SearchStages: 55
CC        BufferStages:
CC        Description: <2% diverged copies. Like the ancient HAL1
CC                     elements, RNHAL1 is close to identical to
CC                     an autonomous L1 (L1_RN) at the 5' end and
CC                     contains a full ORF1 (pos 1086-2186). On
CC                     the other hand, the 3' 1246 bp are unrelated
CC                     to LINEs. In this way it resembles non-autonomous
CC                     LTR elements like MaLRs which have retained
CC                     a GAG gene, but lost the pol gene.      
