CC        Species: Takifugu
CC        SearchStages: 
CC        BufferStages:
CC        Description: The product of ORF 121-1923 is 62% similar
CC                     to the C-terminal part of the pol gene of
CC                     TNT and RIR1 in Rice, and to other representatives
CC                     of the Copia class of LTR elements. The consensus
CC                     is 5' truncated. Very short LTRs. Average
CC                     subst level only 1.2%. perhpas a dozen copies,
CC                     mostly solo-LTRs. First Copia-like element
CC                     in vertebrates. (Kopi is Japanese for copy,
CC                     of course)       
