CC        Species: Takifugu
CC        SearchStages: 
CC        BufferStages:
CC        Description: A few young elements with surprisingly many
CC                     deletions. Clear similarity to Copia-like
CC                     proteins, but no full ORF. Very short LTRs.
CC                     A third copia-like element is present currently
CC                     with only one copy. Kopi1,2 and 3 are about
CC                     80% similar (DNA level). Copies of Kopi1
CC                     and 2 are < 4% diverged from consensus. These
CC                     are the first Copia-liek LTR elements in
CC                     chordates, as far as I know.       
