CC                     the ENV protein (ORF 5781-7241) is most siilar
CC                     to that of class I ERVs in mammals, like
CC                     HERVH48 and Harlequin. First 1354 bp are
CC                     'borrowed' from ENS1, as no full element
CC                     is available and the sequence is identical
CC                     to ENS1 where they overlap elsewhere. ENS3
CC                     named and described by Acloque,H., Risson,V.,
CC                     Birot,A.M., Kunita,R., Pain,B. and  Samarut,J.
