CC        Description: 12% kimura (at least two subs) bp 1-75 are
CC                     tRNA derived, resembling SINE_AF of cychlids,
CC                     bp 181-306 (end) are similar to MER6. Danio
CC                     has similar tRNA-MER6 combination, but the
CC                     tRNA part has a different origin. A SINE_Fugu
CC                     like SINE is found in Perch as well. The
CC                     SINE-MER6 element in Danio has been named
CC                     'mermaid' by a Japanese group (Biochem. Biophys.
CC                     Res. Commun. 220 (1), 226-232 1996). I had
CC                     described them in my dissertation and 1996
