CC                     60% similar) in the "BovB/Expander branch"
CC                     of RTE LINEs. Not closely related to RTE_Mars
CC                     or the original RTE in C elegans. ORF 713-4042,
CC                     but does not start with ATG.  RTESINE1 and
CC                     RTESINE2 have borrowed the promoter region
CC                     from this LINE  (pos 1-524, 1-503), and RTESINE1also
CC                     derived its 3end from this LINE. Thus regions
CC                     are included in the shortlib as a buffer.
