CC                     by a curiously consistent stopcodon at pos
CC                     3873) Closest to (the incomplete) Gyp_MD
CC                     pol of course and to the Danio rerio Gypsy12_DR
CC                     gag and pol proteins, respectively. The known
CC                     LTRs are eutherian-specific, but 20 kb matches
CC                     to the internal in opossum (vs 83 kb in human)
