CC                     assimilated (original at pos 478-707). ORF
CC                     from 2-1335 encodes the N-terminus of a pol
CC                     73% similar (55% identical) to that of CR1-1_CM_pol
CC                     in plownosed chimaeras (of all things). Found
CC                     at orthologous sites in reptiles and mammals,
CC                     it may be ancestral (or granduncle to) to
CC                     L3 in eutherians, PlatCR1 and/or Plat_L3
CC                     in platypus and PSLINE_pol in turtles. Not
