CC   RepeatMasker Annotations:
CC        Type: LINE
CC        SubType: L1
CC        Species: Amniota
CC        SearchStages: 60
CC        BufferStages:
CC        Description: Original entry was a fragment 85% similar
CC                     to current pos 306-449. The current consensus
CC                     contains a complete ORF (46-936) for a gag
CC                     protein matching those found in Xenopus (e.g.
CC                     L1-35_XT, L1-1_XT). The element does not
CC                     necessarily have to be autonomous, and may
CC                     lack an ORF2.No copies observed at sites
CC                     conserved with fish (actually, none outside
CC                     mammals, though copies present in reptiles
CC                     and birds) and no copies found in Xenopus
CC                     or fishes, so downgraded clade from the rather
CC                     far out Euteleosti to Amniota. Consensus
CC                     built in alligator; copies collected in boreoeutherian
CC                     would build the same (though much worse)
CC                     consensus.
//
