CC                     to PlatCR1 in platypus and CR1_Mam, and perhaps
CC                     ancestral to the first. Probably better to
CC                     rename as a subfamily of CR1_Mam. ORF from
CC                     1-999 encodes a protein with 80% identity
CC                     to PlatCR1_pol (AA 590-917)  and about 70%
CC                     to CR1_1b_Xt_pol of Xenopus. 3end is not
