CC        Annotation: tsd=NTCTAGAN
CC        Description: Copies 32% subst excl CpGs in human genome.
CC                     Incorporates both MER103 (pos 72-236) and
CC                     MER103B (1-104, 297->204), with pos 297->204
CC                     (near-)identical to MER103B consensus. MER103
CC                     was merely unfinished. The now-disabled MER103B
CC                     sequence is an internal deletion product
CC                     of Charlie14 (pos 1-51 & 1127-1164 of Charlie14a),
CC                     but there are few copies, if any, that show
CC                     evidence of independent proliferation (e.g.
CC                     the NTCTAGAN target site signature is only
CC                     on one site). Present at orthologous sites
CC                     in all eutherians. Absent from marsupials
CC                     and monotremes.
