CC   RepeatMasker Annotations:
CC        Type: LINE
CC        SubType: CR1
CC        Species: Passeriformes
CC        SearchStages: 
CC        BufferStages:
CC        Description: 15-18%. gag 1-805 (incomplete), pol 790-3782.
CC                     Interesting story: 1) The pol is very close
CC                     to that of chicken CR1-Y (79-80% at DNA level),
CC                     the gag is close to that of chicken CR1-X
CC                     (78% at DNA level) (chicken X & Y are only
CC                     ~65% similar at the DNA level). The junction
CC                     is confirmed by many copies. This indicates
CC                     a recombination in the chicken or the finch
CC                     lineage. Remember that the chicken gag tree
CC                     did not correspond to the pol tree, so a
CC                     recombination in the chicken lineage would
CC                     make sense. 2) There is a distinct frameshift
CC                     in the pol (pos 2959-2969 in this consensus,
CC                     around AA 745 in related pols). The consensus
CC                     is very clear and the frameshift seems to
CC                     break the RT region (make sure), so the retrovirus
CC                     must have had a frameshifting mechanism.
CC                     The frameshift is not in the closely (75-80%)
CC                     related CR1-Ya_Pass consensus..
//
