CC                     full pol ORF (725-3700). The pol is very
CC                     close to that of chicken CR1-Y (82% at DNA
CC                     level), the gag is closest to that of PSLINE
CC                     in a turtle genome and CR1-E (bit no better
CC                     than ca 65% at DNA level). The recombination
CC                     in either the chicken or finch lineage (
