CC        Description: Culled from repbase. Pos 18-401 match Gypsy-gag-like
CC                     protein from Copia-8_DR. Beware: from pos
CC                     1064 on this sequence is a VNTR, (accctccagagctgccag)n,
CC                     (aatggccgccgcctcctgagcttcc)n and finally
CC                     (acgctccaggccctccgcagctcc)n. It is dangerously
CC                     skewed (very C-rich) and gives false positive
CC                     matches to CpG islands like the promoter
CC                     region of L1 in mammals, even with complexity
CC                     adjusted scores.
