CC        Description: NNCTAGNN TSDs. About 500 copies, 29% substituted,
CC                     in the laurasiatherian reconstructed genome.
CC                     Non-autonomous element; ORF 596-904 encodes
CC                     the C terminus of a transposase 79% similar
CC                     to that of hAT-35_SM in the Schmidtea flatworm
CC                     and 76% similar to that of Charlie1. hAT-N11_AP
CC                     in the Pea aphid is so far the closest related
CC                     element. Charlie15a comprises, with some
CC                     differences, pos 1-61 + 69 unmatched bp +
CC                     pos 973-1061 (end). Repbase later named a
CC                     fragment of this (pos 168-498) Eutr6.
