CC        Species: Danio_rerio
CC        SearchStages: 
CC        BufferStages:
CC        Description: Dimer of a 9% diverged hAT-N141_DR copy (pos
CC                     1-194) and a TDR3C copy (100% identical,
CC                     pos 203-396), linked by their shared 8 bp
CC                     TSD.  If the element arose from a pairing
CC                     of these two, TDR19 is likely a derivative
CC                     of TDR19C. Alternatively, TDR3C may have
CC                     spawned from this element. Imperfect (80%
CC                     similar) palindrome, while the right arm
CC                     (TDR3C) is a near-perfect palindrome itself.
